{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Welcome to Crayontopia!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A box of crayons and a dream - that's how it all began. But now, a string of murders threatens this perfect world, and it's up to you to apprehend the killer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Of course, if you'd prefer to ignore the killer and ruin other people's lives, that's A-okay, too!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whichever path you choose, you'll have the opportunity to get to know the cheerful citizens of Crayontopia and uncover the rich lore, hidden gems, and dark secrets of their world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Delve into Crayontopia and enjoy our hand-drawn crayon art.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To ensure an authentic Crayontopia experience, we've used crayons to hand-draw every single character and background in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Investigate the world and uncover evidence.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Scour a variety of locations for clues to learn more about the victims, their ties throughout Crayontopia, and the circumstances surrounding their untimely demise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Interrogate suspects and take them to trial.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Everyone carries secrets. You'll have to unravel each suspect's web of truths and lies to determine  who should stand trial before their fellow citizens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Your choices matter.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Become Crayontopia's ace detective... Or a bumbling buffoon. Just remember, one-too-many mistakes could mean that an innocent citizen is imprisoned - leaving the killer to walk free.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Made by our tiny team of two, we hope you enjoy Crayontopia and all that it has to offer.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Baker Extraordinaire","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3551750/5fabc692d23b21be6fec7ef67f3e87f9bf86aaaf.jpg"},{"name":"Been Snoopin'","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3551750/6486e12bf78b7c57991da9677d3ccc092fc1d5e5.jpg"},{"name":"Rascal Bird","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3551750/c96bfa7435a5e9be76948425ae67d81ac82f98e5.jpg"},{"name":"Hammer Time","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3551750/f5ad4984361c2bfc551f8b0b015e71854e830364.jpg"},{"name":"Remembering Hubert","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3551750/5b872193c5d6344ad443fdaa918541d6d50e0ac8.jpg"},{"name":"Detective Evil","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3551750/948c2e1e2a0c68776b66b5d7ded3f50fa9664710.jpg"},{"name":"Detective Incompetent","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3551750/53522238ef1d97eb083875fa27606750a992c58f.jpg"},{"name":"Investigator Failure","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3551750/db55462936201c773cf4be2ca1868d3b69734a5f.jpg"},{"name":"All-Around Failure","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3551750/7ff955b748dd052d211c805990dac7e471f6338c.jpg"},{"name":"Clean Getaway","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3551750/4718ee1bdd2c038fa593ce017b1f143c719acd80.jpg"}],"total":15},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3551750?t=1744915775","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551750/cecf96cc3bd6f9b2463f4416dc08e1a00fe8a828/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744915775","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551750/1cacb845806b3ec6aa05a67c9dee3871555ec3a5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744915775","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551750/1cacb845806b3ec6aa05a67c9dee3871555ec3a5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744915775","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Welcome to Crayontopia!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A box of crayons and a dream - that's how it all began. But now, a string of murders threatens this perfect world, and it's up to you to apprehend the killer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Of course, if you'd prefer to ignore the killer and ruin other people's lives, that's A-okay, too!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whichever path you choose, you'll have the opportunity to get to know the cheerful citizens of Crayontopia and uncover the rich lore, hidden gems, and dark secrets of their world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Delve into Crayontopia and enjoy our hand-drawn crayon art.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To ensure an authentic Crayontopia experience, we've used crayons to hand-draw every single character and background in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Investigate the world and uncover evidence.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Scour a variety of locations for clues to learn more about the victims, their ties throughout Crayontopia, and the circumstances surrounding their untimely demise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Interrogate suspects and take them to trial.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Everyone carries secrets. You'll have to unravel each suspect's web of truths and lies to determine  who should stand trial before their fellow citizens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Your choices matter.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Become Crayontopia's ace detective... Or a bumbling buffoon. Just remember, one-too-many mistakes could mean that an innocent citizen is imprisoned - leaving the killer to walk free.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Made by our tiny team of two, we hope you enjoy Crayontopia and all that it has to offer.</p>","developers":["Purple Basil Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551750/1de662c8a9b8a11fdc8145bdaac541a2de3cd1cf/header.jpg?t=1744915775","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Linux x86_64<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 1.8 GHz+<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL compatible<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Mac OS X 10.10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 1.8 GHz+<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL compatible<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257101903,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257101903/movie480.mp4?t=1741805228","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257101903/movie_max.mp4?t=1741805228"},"name":"Murder in Crayontopia","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257101903/7be9581973fe2574248fea4cc29f1c807c67a5ba/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1741805228","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257101903/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1741805228","max